  "content": "\n\n<h2>星云微光（红色）</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<h5>（得益于这些特性，您的原版游戏体验将得到进一步提升）</h5>\n<h5>本模组将原版附魔物品与盔甲的标准微光效果替换为酷炫的深红色星云微光，在暗处尤为惊艳！请在辅助功能设置中将“微光强度”调至100%以获得最佳效果。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将其放入您的资源包文件夹中，并在游戏内通过资源包菜单启用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/776/2024-05-10_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"592\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j58K0FVWknU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用服务器，与好友一同畅玩！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或点击下方横幅，并使用代码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>立减25%！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
